44
00:01:27,100 --> 00:01:28,860
The second point is during product design

45
00:01:28,860 --> 00:01:30,140
When creating the PD document

46
00:01:30,140 --> 00:01:31,860
we also include the input and output values

47
00:01:31,860 --> 00:01:33,750
