93
00:03:09,940 --> 00:03:12,649
So, we need to analyze this aspect with them.

94
00:03:12,649 --> 00:03:14,049
What is the reason behind this point?

95
00:03:14,049 --> 00:03:15,969
And how I can address it.

96
00:03:15,969 --> 00:03:16,849
He might even ask,

97
00:03:16,849 --> 00:03:18,869
Can you give an example from a project on your resume?

98
00:03:18,869 --> 00:03:21,000
Then you can just provide him with a specific example.

99
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:24,660
