00:05:37,020 --> 00:05:39,810
Can we all come together for a discussion?

172
00:05:39,810 --> 00:05:42,970
For the second product, during the tablet requirement review,

173
00:05:42,970 --> 00:05:45,170
I will involve the developers to conduct the review together.

174
00:05:45,170 --> 00:05:46,330
