275
00:08:55,760 --> 00:08:56,920
Based on your priorities.

276
00:08:56,920 --> 00:08:58,540
Following the sequence of your workflow.

277
00:08:58,540 --> 00:09:00,120
First, prepare in advance.

278
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:02,520
Our product team will also outline the requirements.

